{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:35bfd062d11e52014bf87c38c1dda796846818f0cbf6ec8d075592abb925aac1",
      "text": "—Oh, Goddess. Why will You not\nanswer?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fd62926cfbd06f533f390bb17f7bffcf6ff84b9cbb439e95c1460d27ed1d2ae1",
      "text": "It was shepherds who reached out their\nhands to the priest grieving alone,\nunanswered, in the Land of Lament.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:19c46d617da06fd3fc4a600792dea2af743dbab064b3fdc0a7c6a2764efb1161",
      "text": "Of course, the shepherds were not\ngods. But the priest saw the will\nof the divine within them.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "15": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:309e79cfa0ca1401ccad3a57a271f92c27132035502e9b750fa4ca04744a3ecc",
      "text": "Reaching out a hand. That is the\nmost important teaching of our\nGoddess of the Stars.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0d7be40c55c21b1a116a3cd3bdf7dd2f21f9c4101a0310307b4f56433c956133",
      "text": "Everyone, be sure to help your\nfriends when they're in trouble.\nMay the stars guide you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a",
      "text": "Okay!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "26": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a67174cf6a0cf7dec8f4b686299e5d9af46954336736add1624d7ed3133c5669",
      "text": "That was interesting. As expected\nof someone from the homeland!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f0b2dac1cae8fcb8c07a95a1a540ff25d9247e9edd508b2b71d404fd57bef496",
      "text": "...By the way, I've never heard\nthat story before...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:52700682608c0a8934260efab0265433be504f6ec88854acae2fe65952372146",
      "text": "It's more history than scripture.\nYou'll get scolded if you preach it\nback home, so be careful.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "36": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7d22127bbae5dabf62d49d8832837bea5960debb63269de45811235d310faeae",
      "text": "Call me if you need anything else.\nI'm basically free all day.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "41": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f57c6104408b81a3a485c0eda673d9c6c44a4b517e5a0605cb57676337179eb6",
      "text": "Y-yes! Thank you so much!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:26a2290309d993c71e8f119e360423601dc037ee3bfda990536ce5dcf76046da",
      "text": "Surprisingly peaceful days\ncontinue. No politics, no grand\nwishes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:26c189124e6721201da9f29762ea1246252eca3ce9f2c1287b40b2aa722d99f5",
      "text": "—I guess that was enough for me.\nPeace. Calm. No big fights. The\ndays just go on.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5e1dc8aceb46ce48a57d313af1a970c667ffe48676eac7b4bcd04fff925f72bc",
      "text": "...That's what I really thought.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9536675419ecaf3e6fc8a218ddd0443fbc4a36aa93af8c40b9a9e3d2854be79c",
      "text": "Ngh... You...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:78a0f99b251d305e94a75a58faab46782258a9345832477e96c5b0b0a67517b6",
      "text": "Going after an orphanage... Before\nconspiracy, money or religion even\ncome into it—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff2264c5ffc91b7b2e9517920d6093b2f836dc36fb4204d05b0ae9db0d5de24d",
      "text": "As a human being, that's just\nwrong, isn't it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b611d032d0baf003272f6f49bab58a71a7fcd747e051e108530261e332e9e01f",
      "text": "Squeak!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:27206e9559e9a779a13fedb1ba6f7301eadb573e12273fab1607e5ca16327bae",
      "text": "—Darkness lurking in all things.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3de49b1550c769386f4ed324791dcddf1c0bedd52e1c2c9d46aedbd1f0b383a",
      "text": "You, a member of House Oxtan,\ndelving into the forbidden—!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ec1f92e1a8e3771298ff9556f2b8672c658c9d0c96bbfee81b0cc2ac79986ae9",
      "text": "Weakness that dwells equally in\nevery heart.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7428945901582c77c4acb7fcd01f6825e11e019b2baf4534fafc44541ff971e2",
      "text": "Invade, defile, violate everything.\nDrag the hidden palace into the\nlight!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9fb432ed58c01936bc58094d0e101d290c465cf1485fbfe92e4f0a8dbf9a4dc6",
      "text": "My star's fine like this. Faith is\nborn in deep darkness to begin\nwith.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ebe369312eb107b32563580292c260b168a7d6ebbefe75c156dec1fef6cca14",
      "text": "...You can't see yet either, can\nyou? Then I'll give you the\nguidance of the stars.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3b3310d41ce7c53708c1d810e6cc4580b72958ff583a702f7ea03e6b846e48ee",
      "text": "...This is a highly confidential\nshop. At a stretch, I can accept\nholding this regular meeting here.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ffdd09439fc8480dd6e0bb891c2639d2562b6149af7ac0f69d1380e6c8baccd",
      "text": "But why are you here, Marden?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:64f74809b08a2cf169958685416519987b3530391bd0edba5a6a1ec11b86389b",
      "text": "Aaah! My chocolates! What is the\nmeaning of this?! I had them\nimported from the homeland!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ad8cd6cd3008cf777c532699e539f856473341fb97b132c07eab6a41b28d115",
      "text": "No bonbons?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:10f51eb4543637965636c524eaaf564b5905913fb09256776c8e7ff09e56fba9",
      "text": "Are you picking a fight?? Bold of\nyou! I could always collect on your\ndebts, you know!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "121": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58c5adaf6074ed5a705a38e4a3a9b50f4669400abd7d94a7727aa774f5fcf6f1",
      "text": "...I'm not a patient man.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6dd6a41928b55ea6ec3380c864c8804ff6adab7973909add5910d5d1a22594df",
      "text": "No, no. I just want to borrow your\nstrength.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d91142eade6842f7b9c659155f96b937645efa22cb044d1e3f3b2c2bb71b324d",
      "text": "Our goal's the same now, right? To\nclear the rot from that country, House\nOxtan is involved no matter what.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:34ee070bf9299d4154eedacdce86de8ff3fc73fa1f5da7ae2a05da41e6042f83",
      "text": "Your own credibility aside, you're\nright that you're not unrelated.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a5c4662e4b0d587f1eb5f26dbd2853203aa68d35df6d3ac72c00ccba2339bf85",
      "text": "Hey, we're both in Starview\nVillage's debt, so let's get along,\nyeah?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0597ac5d595fce6c23dcc95582d142598a56c4f0d7e6bef5ccde3227eb85b4a7",
      "text": "It's no joking matter. There was an\nattempt on the kid's life in\nPalpebra.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1769372419b0de2225c269b8b82d770b93a11a3ee7713fa722c6ec180ec22195",
      "text": "Well, I expected as much. No matter\nhow quiet I stay, to them I'm a\nbomb.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3e2c6b2cb9d9e2f39112db9569051d54786a4a71d2e195b8a16a5339d60db64",
      "text": "...They're lost in the dark too,\nforced to lean on false stars. Then\nI'll at least give them true guidance.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a861b449161599582be15ba39eafe10cb6ab57c855a729a0e2e3ca6d027179cb",
      "text": "That's the kind of person I want to\nbe. ...So please.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "161": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a0225453ebbf0cc21b9841abad273e0988fff7d5cde34a7d5a61b03208eae10",
      "text": "...Understood. The timing is\nconvenient. We're finally seeing\nthe whole picture too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6ff23eb66604002d9ed5b56e54c047a727994548240b848e93bd9cd894a823b",
      "text": "You really understand? Even after I\ngot inside, I still couldn't see\nit.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ae8103601f6503ec714d858d05ff275586caec8ccf03a9a8256c4e1bbac680c0",
      "text": "The assassination attempt was the\nstarting point after all. The Star\nAugurs were moving from that time.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a6763a9e6a3b4e2b7928c6f7de2ee7d9e7dc11ed0875fc1a090abfa3c64ccc6",
      "text": "Back then House Kwetur was divided.\nExtremists out to regain its old glory\ndemanded the doctrine be \"corrected.\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bef19d7a3b5809ecc8d679f2f284fbe3a329a56c6ed0a1ea21c50ba9cec06d8f",
      "text": "...An extremist runaway, just like\nyou. The Star Augurs \"lent a hand\"\nto cover it up.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:85441a53fd06ecb306e3d8d32f0b97ad61e9c708ea91d192445318c308fd8913",
      "text": "Cleanup's too good for a fool's\nrunaway. Which means they lit the\nfire themselves.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:85ba2240a69c60ee92d71ea2369e993e351c2e37cbe59dec37c07a6478befac1",
      "text": "...I see. The head family has it\nrough too. They were made to create\na weakness that splits the country.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "187": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f53c9c4cbc5106e1463d05b71d68c8b26c2a90d8421e58d21ed2435506724ab0",
      "text": "But that's only the entrance. I've\nheard the Star Augurs also got into\nHouse Sextan before...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8acca8294f2435c085a7025dc0b56d3ae76d28cea3349e356c02994c3e38cdbd",
      "text": "...Right. Then let's go fishing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4eeae2671eb977800310e7fa96f3da6f3a9971f473c2845e713c7859ac2f1b1f",
      "text": "Their research subject in the\nFarlands. The perfect bait. And\nit's right in front of us.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:af1d4cd52499ff0126394726a7d02c7da5bf7028461adb03fd446fc865750461",
      "text": "......Squeak!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:257643045c3fe61c7e5f57660466302b4a6053b36a81e8f15c7e2106b4df558b",
      "text": "I see...? But in the end, wouldn't\nyou be the bait yourself?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cc4ee2ece19c9250b933b7afed5c87380bddca51690ad1f2e9086e611d120fc2",
      "text": "Just make it flashy. Big enough that\nthey have to move, like it or not.\nThen even outsiders can see it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e614e7467b4df2b11ea8bbee784f38c011bb4e32fdbaf830e5bb5aba719b76bf",
      "text": "Let's see... Should I fabricate a\nnew scripture about this guy?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:348b63974f957ce778eb5d7d37d289f927c722fb0e15f9a70ac2e8e7c900eee5",
      "text": "...Are you sure about that, kid?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d540f12b994b49bb0948f5e53e54bc65784942bc50c58f2a5d31ef08ac6c25b7",
      "text": "Yeah. This is my reckoning. Please.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "230": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a920dc5679eb41f231ff4583bea8532cb2edaa2af4b70ac000f0acea223a5bf7",
      "text": "Fine. I'd bet on the kid. What\nabout you, Commander?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "234": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2437a3514c13468271a4d25916950133e840ad508e18b3d38e4314dd44b0bdab",
      "text": "...We'll have to involve His\nHighness and Lord Orvelle for the\ndetails. Count on you, Libram.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d26b02cedfa24b6f511a9ed22ead8af2f1acc55c97193f338a1745dcf01b62f4",
      "text": "Me?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "244": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:05c8402d1ffa462e334c411f278295ecd359792e580d9cb5f616d6dbc385ddb4",
      "text": "Oh, very well, very well! It is\nindeed my role!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "247": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e1b7f9a55764114f74d1579b541e67f0d8ce2fb79b3c3d2577aba0ef352e91d1",
      "text": "...Besides, the fool who only ever\nbegs for coin has relied on me for\nthe first time. I shall cooperate!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "251": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ab46b6bb54a754236d826f6e933d63c40ac433b8ef0f0a5b139b784802857d55",
      "text": "Thank you, Libram.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "255": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4f064fda59452b9e78075a86db9dbac5313a76205e2cc3c4bf99d9f8c2d0567",
      "text": "—It has been a while, Marden! Have\nyou been well?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "259": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b934ffc91262adc345c25610e72474e7c4a4a3dcb19566badaf73cfd3386df6a",
      "text": "Yes, Your Highness. The city you\nsent me to is an outrageous place.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "262": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4181e79d9183544924b0d1cc4f0865ed763faf93e6fe9b129ca3af27ffb42e1b",
      "text": "I'll be blunt. Want to help me\nscheme?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "266": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c1032f592d280cb6801555264bf1f348f449f6212707c0e20da7033201b59ee6",
      "text": "Hm, you have prepared at least a\npretext?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "271": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5a8560370fe7ff118fae6893fc26106c206eb4c37fb8208df5e725b1c01757b1",
      "text": "Of course. A real beauty.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "274": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a077423708d9312354c716d7a37a2b18e474bdf6503a8bad800a8b3b2035bc46",
      "text": "—Now, let's talk, Your Highness.\nFor the people.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
